repository-code: "https://github.com/Dadmin88/hermes-fleet"
url: "https://github.com/Dadmin88/hermes-fleet"
license: "AGPL-3.0-only"
abstract: >-
  Hermes Fleet is an operator-controlled control plane for distributed Hermes systems,
  coordinating trusted device identity, authenticated inter-machine transport,
  Fleet authorization, readiness, placement, exact execution, and operator surfaces
  while preserving explicit ownership boundaries with Hermes Agent, Hermes Keryx,
  Hermes Nodescale, and Hermes Agency.
